{
  "story_id": "whale-road",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 368568,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "It was a habit Vidar had — he watched the bay.",
      "start_ms": 1317,
      "end_ms": 4131
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "He had done it since he was old enough to sit still.",
      "start_ms": 4131,
      "end_ms": 7305
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Every day, at least once, he went down to the shore and sat on the big flat black basalt rock at the edge of the water, and he looked out.",
      "start_ms": 7305,
      "end_ms": 15628
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Bjarni had bought him a small pair of binoculars for his ninth birthday.",
      "start_ms": 15628,
      "end_ms": 19999
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Vidar took them everywhere.",
      "start_ms": 19999,
      "end_ms": 21675
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He watched for whales.",
      "start_ms": 21675,
      "end_ms": 23053
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He watched for the whale.",
      "start_ms": 23053,
      "end_ms": 24609
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "He knew, in his head, that it might not come for years, or that if it came it might come tomorrow, and either way he could not know.",
      "start_ms": 24609,
      "end_ms": 32573
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "But he watched anyway.",
      "start_ms": 32573,
      "end_ms": 34010
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "He saw many things over the years.",
      "start_ms": 34010,
      "end_ms": 36106
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "He saw pods of pilot whales going through the outer strait.",
      "start_ms": 36106,
      "end_ms": 39698
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "He saw dolphins.",
      "start_ms": 39698,
      "end_ms": 40716
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "He saw a lone humpback once, very far away, blowing spray.",
      "start_ms": 40716,
      "end_ms": 44249
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "He saw seals and puffins and gannets diving.",
      "start_ms": 44249,
      "end_ms": 46943
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "He did not see a killer whale.",
      "start_ms": 46943,
      "end_ms": 48800
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Not for the first three summers he really watched.",
      "start_ms": 48800,
      "end_ms": 51853
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Not for the fourth.",
      "start_ms": 51853,
      "end_ms": 53051
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "He was ten now, and he had been watching for almost three years, and he had begun to accept that maybe it would not come while he was still small.",
      "start_ms": 53051,
      "end_ms": 61853
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Maybe he would be a teenager.",
      "start_ms": 61853,
      "end_ms": 63649
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "Maybe he would be a grown man.",
      "start_ms": 63649,
      "end_ms": 65505
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Maybe he would be as old as Bjarni.",
      "start_ms": 65505,
      "end_ms": 67661
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "That was okay.",
      "start_ms": 67661,
      "end_ms": 68559
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "He would keep watching.",
      "start_ms": 68559,
      "end_ms": 70056
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "It came in the middle of July.",
      "start_ms": 70056,
      "end_ms": 71912
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "It was a rare warm sunny day — the kind that only happens in the Faroes maybe five days a year — and the sea in the bay was flat and glassy.",
      "start_ms": 71912,
      "end_ms": 80355
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Vidar had been watching for an hour.",
      "start_ms": 80355,
      "end_ms": 82570
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "He was about to go up to the cottage for lunch.",
      "start_ms": 82570,
      "end_ms": 85444
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "He was standing up on the rock.",
      "start_ms": 85444,
      "end_ms": 87360
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "And then, at the mouth of the bay, he saw a tall dark shape rise slowly out of the water.",
      "start_ms": 87360,
      "end_ms": 92749
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "A dorsal fin.",
      "start_ms": 92749,
      "end_ms": 93587
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Very tall.",
      "start_ms": 93587,
      "end_ms": 94246
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Male.",
      "start_ms": 94246,
      "end_ms": 94605
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Very close to the cottage side of the bay.",
      "start_ms": 94605,
      "end_ms": 97180
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "It was moving.",
      "start_ms": 97180,
      "end_ms": 98078
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "It was coming in.",
      "start_ms": 98078,
      "end_ms": 99096
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "For a moment Vidar could not move.",
      "start_ms": 99096,
      "end_ms": 101531
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "He could not breathe.",
      "start_ms": 101531,
      "end_ms": 103061
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "He watched the fin get closer.",
      "start_ms": 103061,
      "end_ms": 105218
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "He watched it come in through the mouth.",
      "start_ms": 105218,
      "end_ms": 108070
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "It did not surface again for a while — the whale must have dived under — and Vidar stood on the rock with his heart beating in his ears, hoping.",
      "start_ms": 108070,
      "end_ms": 118157
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Then, closer, only about thirty meters from his rock, the whale surfaced again.",
      "start_ms": 118157,
      "end_ms": 123722
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "A huge black-and-white shape.",
      "start_ms": 123722,
      "end_ms": 125809
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "It rolled slightly onto its side.",
      "start_ms": 125809,
      "end_ms": 128174
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "And a single dark eye — enormous, close, very intelligent — came out of the water and looked at Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 128174,
      "end_ms": 135409
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Vidar could not move.",
      "start_ms": 135409,
      "end_ms": 136939
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "The whale was as long as the cottage.",
      "start_ms": 136939,
      "end_ms": 139583
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "His fin alone was taller than Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 139583,
      "end_ms": 142157
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "His eye was the size of Vidar's fist.",
      "start_ms": 142157,
      "end_ms": 144800
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "His eye was looking at Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 144800,
      "end_ms": 146887
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Really looking.",
      "start_ms": 146887,
      "end_ms": 148000
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Not the way an animal usually looks at a person.",
      "start_ms": 148000,
      "end_ms": 151409
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "The way the swan had bowed to Elin, Vidar thought later — that kind of looking, with something behind it.",
      "start_ms": 151409,
      "end_ms": 158783
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "He was here.",
      "start_ms": 158783,
      "end_ms": 159687
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "He had come.",
      "start_ms": 159687,
      "end_ms": 160591
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "He had come this summer.",
      "start_ms": 160591,
      "end_ms": 162330
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "And he was looking at Vidar and he was waiting.",
      "start_ms": 162330,
      "end_ms": 165739
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Vidar remembered the song.",
      "start_ms": 165739,
      "end_ms": 167617
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "He knew it perfectly.",
      "start_ms": 167617,
      "end_ms": 169148
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "But his throat had closed.",
      "start_ms": 169148,
      "end_ms": 171026
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "He tried to sing and he could not.",
      "start_ms": 171026,
      "end_ms": 173461
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "He was too afraid.",
      "start_ms": 173461,
      "end_ms": 174783
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "He looked at the whale and the whale looked at him and Vidar tried again and his voice came out very small and shaky, cracking on the first note.",
      "start_ms": 174783,
      "end_ms": 184939
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "He stopped.",
      "start_ms": 184939,
      "end_ms": 185774
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "He tried again.",
      "start_ms": 185774,
      "end_ms": 186887
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "His voice broke again.",
      "start_ms": 186887,
      "end_ms": 188487
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "He was crying now, without wanting to.",
      "start_ms": 188487,
      "end_ms": 191200
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "He was ten years old and he had been preparing for this his whole life and the whale was here and he could not sing.",
      "start_ms": 191200,
      "end_ms": 199409
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "He turned and he ran.",
      "start_ms": 199409,
      "end_ms": 200939
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "He ran up the stone path as fast as he could.",
      "start_ms": 200939,
      "end_ms": 204139
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "He was crying.",
      "start_ms": 204139,
      "end_ms": 205182
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "He was shouting for Bjarni.",
      "start_ms": 205182,
      "end_ms": 207130
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Bjarni came out of the cottage — he had been reading — with a very worried face.",
      "start_ms": 207130,
      "end_ms": 212765
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "\"What is it.",
      "start_ms": 212765,
      "end_ms": 213669
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "What is wrong.\" Vidar could not really talk.",
      "start_ms": 213669,
      "end_ms": 216800
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "He was pointing at the bay.",
      "start_ms": 216800,
      "end_ms": 218748
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "He said, \"Grandpa.",
      "start_ms": 218748,
      "end_ms": 220069
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "It.",
      "start_ms": 220069,
      "end_ms": 220348
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Him.",
      "start_ms": 220348,
      "end_ms": 220695
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "It.",
      "start_ms": 220695,
      "end_ms": 220974
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "He is here.",
      "start_ms": 220974,
      "end_ms": 221808
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "He came.",
      "start_ms": 221808,
      "end_ms": 222435
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "He is waiting.",
      "start_ms": 222435,
      "end_ms": 223478
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I could not sing.",
      "start_ms": 223478,
      "end_ms": 224730
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "I could not sing, Grandpa.",
      "start_ms": 224730,
      "end_ms": 226608
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "My voice would not come.\" Bjarni's whole face changed.",
      "start_ms": 226608,
      "end_ms": 230434
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "He said, \"Oh, boy.\" And he grabbed Vidar's hand and they ran together back down to the shore.",
      "start_ms": 230434,
      "end_ms": 236904
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "The whale was still there.",
      "start_ms": 236904,
      "end_ms": 238858
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "He was still on his side.",
      "start_ms": 238858,
      "end_ms": 240740
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "He was still watching the rock.",
      "start_ms": 240740,
      "end_ms": 243057
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "He had not left.",
      "start_ms": 243057,
      "end_ms": 244287
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Bjarni saw him and he stopped for a moment on the path.",
      "start_ms": 244287,
      "end_ms": 248340
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "He said, \"Oh.",
      "start_ms": 248340,
      "end_ms": 249354
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "He is beautiful.",
      "start_ms": 249354,
      "end_ms": 250584
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Look at him.",
      "start_ms": 250584,
      "end_ms": 251525
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Look at how big he is.\" Then he looked at Vidar.",
      "start_ms": 251525,
      "end_ms": 255072
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Vidar was still crying.",
      "start_ms": 255072,
      "end_ms": 256809
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Bjarni knelt down.",
      "start_ms": 256809,
      "end_ms": 258184
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "He held Vidar's shoulders.",
      "start_ms": 258184,
      "end_ms": 260139
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "\"Vidar,\" he said.",
      "start_ms": 260139,
      "end_ms": 261442
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "\"Listen.",
      "start_ms": 261442,
      "end_ms": 262093
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "It is okay.",
      "start_ms": 262093,
      "end_ms": 262962
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He is still waiting.",
      "start_ms": 262962,
      "end_ms": 264482
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "He will not leave until you sing.",
      "start_ms": 264482,
      "end_ms": 266943
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "You have all the time in the world.",
      "start_ms": 266943,
      "end_ms": 269549
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Take a breath.",
      "start_ms": 269549,
      "end_ms": 270634
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Look at me.",
      "start_ms": 270634,
      "end_ms": 271503
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "Take another breath.",
      "start_ms": 271503,
      "end_ms": 273023
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Now.",
      "start_ms": 273023,
      "end_ms": 273385
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "We are going to sing it together.",
      "start_ms": 273385,
      "end_ms": 275846
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "You and me.",
      "start_ms": 275846,
      "end_ms": 276714
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Are you ready?\" Vidar nodded.",
      "start_ms": 276714,
      "end_ms": 278886
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "\"Are you ready?\" \"Yes, Grandpa.",
      "start_ms": 278886,
      "end_ms": 281202
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "I am ready.\"",
      "start_ms": 281202,
      "end_ms": 282216
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "They walked down to the rock together.",
      "start_ms": 282216,
      "end_ms": 285038
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Bjarni went first.",
      "start_ms": 285038,
      "end_ms": 286414
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "He stood at the front of the rock.",
      "start_ms": 286414,
      "end_ms": 288947
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Vidar stood beside him.",
      "start_ms": 288947,
      "end_ms": 290684
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "The whale was still there.",
      "start_ms": 290684,
      "end_ms": 292639
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Bjarni looked at the whale and the whale looked at Bjarni, and Bjarni nodded, once, respectfully, to the whale.",
      "start_ms": 292639,
      "end_ms": 300745
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Then Bjarni began to sing.",
      "start_ms": 300745,
      "end_ms": 302700
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Bjarni's voice was old and cracked but he knew the song better than anyone alive.",
      "start_ms": 302700,
      "end_ms": 308635
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "He sang the first note, low and long.",
      "start_ms": 308635,
      "end_ms": 311386
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "And Vidar — after a moment — joined him.",
      "start_ms": 311386,
      "end_ms": 314353
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "His voice was still shaky.",
      "start_ms": 314353,
      "end_ms": 316308
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "But it held.",
      "start_ms": 316308,
      "end_ms": 317249
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "He sang along with Bjarni, small at first, then stronger.",
      "start_ms": 317249,
      "end_ms": 321447
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "They sang the first verse together.",
      "start_ms": 321447,
      "end_ms": 324125
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "The whale did not move.",
      "start_ms": 324125,
      "end_ms": 325862
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "He listened.",
      "start_ms": 325862,
      "end_ms": 326803
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "He was completely still.",
      "start_ms": 326803,
      "end_ms": 328613
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "Only his tail moved slightly under the water, keeping him in position.",
      "start_ms": 328613,
      "end_ms": 333752
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "When they finished the first verse, Bjarni paused for the small silence that came between the verses.",
      "start_ms": 333752,
      "end_ms": 341135
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Then he began the second.",
      "start_ms": 341135,
      "end_ms": 343017
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Vidar sang along.",
      "start_ms": 343017,
      "end_ms": 344320
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "And by the second verse Vidar's voice was clear and steady and he did not need Bjarni anymore, and Bjarni fell quiet, and Vidar sang the second verse alone.",
      "start_ms": 344320,
      "end_ms": 355684
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "His voice was small but true.",
      "start_ms": 355684,
      "end_ms": 357855
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "He sang it slowly, the way Bjarni had always taught him.",
      "start_ms": 357855,
      "end_ms": 361981
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "He held the notes the right length.",
      "start_ms": 361981,
      "end_ms": 364587
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "He did not rush.",
      "start_ms": 364587,
      "end_ms": 365817
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "He looked at the whale the whole time.",
      "start_ms": 365817,
      "end_ms": 368568
    }
  ]
}